Replaces the matching pending transition and consumes the pending wait. The immediate textSize() setter interrupts this channel; unrelated channels continue.

\param target Finite target font size.
\param seconds Required finite, nonnegative duration in seconds. Zero applies the target immediately. After wait() or andThen(), duration must be greater than zero.
\param easing EasingFunc callback, such as linearTween or easeInOutQuad. Its elapsed time and duration arguments are seconds.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see textSize(), AnimatedBase::wait(), animate()
*/

/**
\fn AnimatedAttributesBase & pdg::AnimatedAttributesBase::changeSubsection(const Rect & target, double seconds, EasingFunc easing)
