Replaces the matching pending transition and consumes the pending wait. The immediate subsection() setter interrupts this channel; unrelated channels continue.

\param target Target Rect in source-image coordinates.
\param seconds Required finite, nonnegative duration in seconds. Zero applies the target immediately. After wait() or andThen(), duration must be greater than zero.
\param easing EasingFunc callback, such as linearTween or easeInOutQuad. Its elapsed time and duration arguments are seconds.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see subsection(), AnimatedBase::wait(), animate()
*/

/**
\fn AnimatedAttributesBase & pdg::AnimatedAttributesBase::changePolarOffset(const Offset & target, double seconds, EasingFunc easing)
\brief Animate sphere polar offset.

Replaces the matching pending transition and consumes the pending wait. The immediate polarOffset() setter interrupts this channel; unrelated channels continue.

\param target Target Offset for spherical image mapping.
\param seconds Required finite, nonnegative duration in seconds. Zero applies the target immediately. After wait() or andThen(), duration must be greater than zero.
\param easing EasingFunc callback, such as linearTween or easeInOutQuad. Its elapsed time and duration arguments are seconds.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see polarOffset(), AnimatedBase::wait(), animate()
