/**
\fn AnimatedAttributesBase & pdg::AnimatedAttributesBase::changeAmbientLight(const Color & target, double seconds, EasingFunc easing)
\brief Animate ambient light color.

Replaces the matching pending transition and consumes the pending wait. The immediate ambientLight() setter interrupts this channel; unrelated channels continue.

\param target Target Color for ambient lighting.
\param seconds Required finite, nonnegative duration in seconds. Zero applies the target immediately. After wait() or andThen(), duration must be greater than zero.
\param easing EasingFunc callback, such as linearTween or easeInOutQuad. Its elapsed time and duration arguments are seconds.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see ambientLight(), AnimatedBase::wait(), animate()
